Section: multiverse/libs
Priority: optional
Package: libnvidia-ml1-fake
Version: 9999.9999.9999
Architecture: amd64
Provides: libnvidia-ml1, libnvidia-ml.so.1
Description: Fake NVML provider (GPU operator handles real libs)
  Packages such as nvitop depend on libnvidia-ml1 (NVML). In containerized
  environments the real libnvidia-ml.so.1 is not installed via packages, but
  is provided by tools like `nvidia-container-toolkit` or the k8s GPU Operator.
  .
  This empty (mock) package provides libnvidia-ml1 and libnvidia-ml.so.1, so
  that apt/dpkg can satisfy the dependency without pulling in real NVIDIA
  driver packages.
